f\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-width:medium 1pt 1pt; border-style:none solid solid; border-color:currentcolor; padding:0in 5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:116.6pt\"><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><b>FTE Hours:</b></span></p></td><td style=\"border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style:none solid solid none; border-color:currentcolor; padding:0in 5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:297pt\"><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\">.90</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-width:medium 1pt 1pt; border-style:none solid solid; border-color:currentcolor; padding:0in 5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:116.6pt\"><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><b>Reports to:</b></span></p></td><td style=\"border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style:none solid solid none; border-color:currentcolor; padding:0in 5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:297pt\"><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\">Clinical Manager</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-width:medium 1pt 1pt; border-style:none solid solid; border-color:currentcolor; padding:0in 5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:116.6pt\"><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><b>Job Description Status:</b></span></p></td><td style=\"border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style:none solid solid none; border-color:currentcolor; padding:0in 5.4pt; vertical-align:top; width:297pt\"><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\">Complete, information for position template indicated below:</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"line-height:115%; margin:0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:115%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><b>Position Summary:</b></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in; margin-bottom:0in\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; margin:0in 0in 12pt\">The Robotics Coordinator/RNFA Trainee functions as a Registered Nurse in the Operating Room while developing the clinical, technical, and operational knowledge, skills, and competencies necessary to perform the responsibilities of the Robotics Coordinator/RNFA role. Working under the direction of Surgical Services leadership, the incumbent provides direct patient care and progressively assumes additional responsibilities in support of robotic surgical services.</li></ul><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><b>Education:</b></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in; margin-bottom:0in\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; line-height:115%; margin:0in\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:115%\">Associate’s degree in Nursing (ADN) is required</span></li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; line-height:115%; margin:0in\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:115%\">Bachelor’s degree in Nursing (BSN) is required within two (2) years of date of hire or transfer into role.</span></li></ul><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"line-height:115%; margin:0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:115%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"line-height:115%; margin:0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:115%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><b>License and/or certification::</b></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in; margin-bottom:0in\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; margin:0in 0in 12pt\">Licensed and currently registered to practice as a Registered Nurse in the state of residency</li></ul><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><b>Experience:</b></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in; margin-bottom:0in\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; line-height:115%; margin:0in\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:115%\">Minimum one (1) year of Operating Room Nursing experience is required.</span></li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; line-height:115%; margin:0in\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:115%\">Robotic surgery experience preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><b>Schedule:</b></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in; margin-bottom:0in\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; line-height:115%; margin:0in\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; line-height:115%\">May be assigned to day, evening, or night shifts or a combination per departmental policy.</span></li></ul><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(0,58,112)\"><b>Filippa Etherton, SHRM-SCP<br></b>Compensation Manager<br>Human Resources<br><b>TidalHealth<br>O </b>410-912-6744<br>mytidalhealth.org</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(0,58,112)\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(0,58,112)\">Have a question for HR? Submit a ticket to Shared Services;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe Script&quot;; font-size:11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(70,120,134)\"><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-